e},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2018-12-03T13:54:44Z","assignee":{"login":"aehlig","id":9567293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NjcyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9567293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig","html_url":"https://github.com/aehlig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/444950918","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6725#issuecomment-444950918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6725","id":444950918,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0NDk1MDkxOA==","user":{"login":"aehlig","id":9567293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NjcyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9567293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig","html_url":"https://github.com/aehlig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-12-06T17:10:20Z","updated_at":"2018-12-06T17:10:20Z","body":"> Accessing things via `//external:<repo-name>` is not recommended.\n> However you seem to hit some other issues, starting with the\n> processing of your WORKSPACE file. We definitely should not crash.\n\nThe whole `//external` virtual package seems like a hack. A minimal\nexample for the crash is the following.\n\n```\nmkdir local\ntouch local/BUILD\nmkdir main\ncd main\necho 'local_repository(name=\"local\", path=\"../local\")' > WORKSPACE\nbazel build //external:local\n```\n\nThe error message is also quite telling: `No such attribute tags\nin local_repository rule //external:local`, i.e., even though the\nrule in charge for that target is a repository rule, it is treated\nlike a normal build rule, that should have tags, etc. That most\nlikely also explains the error message in the other case: if we\nexecute the implementaiton function of a repsoitory rule (in this\ncase http_archive) with a rule context instead of a repository_rule\ncontext as an argument, we ask for trouble and expect to see the\nerror message we've seen.\n\nInterestingly enough, it is not the case that the local repository is\nactually mapped at that place; it is just the target for the repository\nrule. Asking for something like `bazel build //external/local/...`\nor `bazel build //external/local:it` does not even find the BUILD\nfile of the directory `local`, regardless what the contents of that\nfile are.\n\nAnd that is not even talking about the case that you have a directory\ncalled `external` at the top-level of your workspace...\n\n-- \nKlaus Aehlig\nGoogle Germany GmbH, Erika-Mann-Str. 33, 80636 Muenchen\nRegistergericht und -nummer: Hamburg, HRB 86891\nSitz der Gesellschaft: Hamburg\nGeschaeftsfuehrer: Paul Terence Manicle, Halimah DeLaine Prado\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/444950918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"aehlig","id":9567293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NjcyOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9567293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig","html_url":"https://github.com/aehlig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aehlig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2012879351,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDIwMTI4NzkzNTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/2012879351","actor":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io","html_url":"https://github.com/bazel-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti